    "8 GB 以上。轉錄加說話者辨識時最高約 2.9 GB，長錄音分段轉錄，會議長短影響不大（4 小時的會議 2.9 GB，M3 Pro 實測）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8 GB or more. Transcription plus speaker recognition peaks at about 2.9 GB. Long recordings are transcribed in parts, so meeting length makes little difference (a 4-hour meeting: 2.9 GB, measured on M3 Pro)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8 GB 以上。转录加说话者识别时最高约 2.9 GB，长录音分段转录，会议长短影响不大（4 小时的会议 2.9 GB，M3 Pro 实测）"
          }
