    "Claude Code 的用量額度用完了，等恢復後再試，或到設定 → 整理工具先換成 Codex 或 API。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code is out of usage until it resets. Try again then, or switch to Codex or an API in Settings → Summarizer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 的用量额度用完了，等恢复后再试，或到设置 → 整理工具先换成 Codex 或 API。"
          }
