    "Claude Code 還沒登入或登入已過期，請重新登入後再試一次（終端機指令：claude auth login）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code isn’t signed in, or its sign-in has expired. Sign in again and try once more (Terminal command: claude auth login)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 还没登录或登录已过期，请重新登录后再试一次（终端命令：claude auth login）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code 還沒登入，登入之後才能整理（終端機指令：claude auth login）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code isn’t signed in. Sign in to summarize (Terminal command: claude auth login)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code 还没登录，登录之后才能整理（终端命令：claude auth login）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code、Claude Desktop、Codex 等支援 MCP 的 AI 工具可以搜尋、讀你的會議紀錄和逐字稿（只能讀、不能改），拾音不用開著。讀到的內容會交給那個 AI 工具處理，跟整理會議紀錄一樣會離開這台電腦。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI tools that support MCP, such as Claude Code, Claude Desktop and Codex, can search and read your meeting notes and transcripts (read-only), even when Shiyin isn't open. What they read is handled by that AI tool and leaves this Mac, just like when meeting notes are written."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code、Claude Desktop、Codex 等支持 MCP 的 AI 工具可以搜索、读你的会议记录和逐字稿（只能读、不能改），拾音不用开着。读到的内容会交给那个 AI 工具处理，跟整理会议记录一样会离开这台电脑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code、Claude Desktop、Codex 等支援 MCP 的 AI 工具可以直接讀拾音的會議：到「設定 → 進階 → AI 工具（MCP）」打開「讓 AI 工具讀取會議」，再按「加到 Claude Code」「加到 Codex」或「加到 Claude Desktop」。其他工具用「複製」自己貼上設定。拾音不用開著。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI tools that support MCP, such as Claude Code, Claude Desktop and Codex, can read your Shiyin meetings directly: in Settings › Advanced › AI tools (MCP), turn on “Let AI tools read meetings”, then click “Add to Claude Code”, “Add to Codex” or “Add to Claude Desktop”. For other tools, use Copy and paste the settings yourself. Shiyin doesn't need to be open."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code、Claude Desktop、Codex 等支持 MCP 的 AI 工具可以直接读拾音的会议：到“设置 → 高级 → AI 工具（MCP）”打开“让 AI 工具读取会议”，再按“加到 Claude Code”“加到 Codex”或“加到 Claude Desktop”。其他工具用“复制”自己粘贴设置。拾音不用开着。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
