    "Zoom、Teams、Webex、Google Meet（瀏覽器）等開始用麥克風、拾音沒在錄音時提醒你；會議結束時提醒停止。只提醒，不會自動錄音。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When Zoom, Teams, Webex, Google Meet (in a browser) or a similar app starts using the microphone and Shiyin isn't recording, Shiyin asks whether to record, and asks again when the meeting seems to end. It only asks; it never records on its own."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoom、Teams、Webex、Google Meet（浏览器）等开始用麦克风、拾音没在录音时提醒你；会议结束时提醒停止。只提醒，不会自动录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
