          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时逐字稿、正式转录、说话者识别都在本地进行，不需要网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即時逐字稿已在設定中關閉，錄音結束後會正式轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The live transcript is turned off in Settings. The recording will be transcribed when it ends."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时逐字稿已在设置中关闭，录音结束后会正式转录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即時逐字稿沒辦法啟動（%@），錄音照常進行，錄完會正式轉錄": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The live transcript couldn't start (%@). Recording continues and will be transcribed afterwards."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时逐字稿没办法启动（%@），录音照常进行，录完会正式转录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原因：%@\n\n你的資料沒有被改動。升級前的備份在：%@\n請把這個訊息截圖給維護拾音的人。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reason: %@\n\nYour data has not been changed. The backup made before the upgrade is in: %@\nPlease send a screenshot of this message to whoever maintains Shiyin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原因：%@\n\n你的资料没有被改动。升级前的备份在：%@\n请把这个消息截图给维护拾音的人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原本取過的名字會盡量保留，其他說話者會用聲紋比對、再用整理工具猜名字。會議紀錄不會自動更新。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Names you've given are kept where possible; other speakers are matched by voiceprint, then the summarizer guesses their names. The meeting notes aren't updated automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原本取过的名字会尽量保留，其他说话者会用声纹比对、再用整理工具猜名字。会议记录不会自动更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
