    "只影響中文會議的逐字稿、會議紀錄和匯出，介面文字不變。已經做好的會議不會變，重新轉錄或重新整理後才會換。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to transcripts, meeting notes and exports of Chinese meetings; the interface doesn’t change. Existing meetings stay as they are until you transcribe or summarize them again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只影响中文会议的逐字稿、会议记录和导出，界面文字不变。已经做好的会议不会变，重新转录或重新整理后才会换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只看某一位說話者的內容": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show only one speaker"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
