          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只能匯入錄音、影片、逐字稿（srt、vtt、txt）、Markdown 或 .shiyin 檔": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can only import audio, video, transcripts (srt, vtt, txt), Markdown or .shiyin files"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只能导入录音、视频、逐字稿（srt、vtt、txt）、Markdown 或 .shiyin 文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只能讀、不能改；垃圾桶裡的會議、正在錄的會議讀不到。讀到的會議內容會交給那個 AI 工具處理，跟整理會議紀錄一樣會離開這台 Mac；關掉開關就讀不到了。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read-only: AI tools can't change anything, and meetings in the Trash or still being recorded aren't available. The meeting content they read is handled by that AI tool and leaves this Mac, just like when meeting notes are written. Turn the switch off to stop access."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只能读、不能改；回收站里的会议、正在录的会议读不到。读到的会议内容会交给那个 AI 工具处理，跟整理会议记录一样会离开这台 Mac；关掉开关就读不到了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只送這一條的題目；有回答的交給整理工具依答案修正，略過的直接移除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the questions for this item are sent; answered ones go to the summarizer to revise the notes, skipped ones are removed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只送这一条的题目；有回答的交给整理工具依答案修正，略过的直接移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只重新分辨誰在說話，逐字稿的文字不會變": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only works out again who is speaking; the transcript text stays the same"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只重新分辨谁在说话，逐字稿的文字不会变"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只重新分辨誰在說話，逐字稿的文字不會變。人多、吵雜或手機遠距收音時，告訴拾音大約幾個人會分得比較準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only works out again who is speaking; the transcript text doesn't change. With many people, a noisy room or a phone recording from across the table, telling Shiyin roughly how many people there are helps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只重新分辨谁在说话，逐字稿的文字不会变。人多、吵杂或手机远距收音时，告诉拾音大约几个人会分得比较准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
