    },
    "把逐字稿裡的錯字換成正確寫法，會議紀錄裡同樣的字也會一起改。區分大小寫。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Replace a misheard word in the transcript with the correct spelling; the same word in the meeting notes changes too. Case-sensitive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把逐字稿里的错字换成正确写法，会议记录里同样的字也会一起改。区分大小写。"
          }
        }
      }
