    },
    "拾音讀不了沒有副檔名的檔案。請先匯出成 PDF 再加入。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin can't read files without an extension. Export it as PDF and add that instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拾音读不了没有扩展名的文件。请先导出成 PDF 再加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音讀不了舊版的 Word 檔（.doc）。請另存成 docx 或 PDF 再加入。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin can't read old Word files (.doc). Save it as docx or PDF and add that instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拾音读不了旧版的 Word 文件（.doc）。请另存成 docx 或 PDF 再加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拾音：正在打開瀏覽器登入 %@。登入完成後，回到拾音按「重試」或「測試整理工具」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shiyin: opening your browser to sign in to %@. When you’re done, go back to Shiyin and click “Retry” or “Test Summarizer”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拾音：正在打开浏览器登录 %@。登录完成后，回到拾音按“重试”或“测试整理工具”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「停止並轉錄」後，拾音會在這台 Mac 上重新轉錄（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，%@用 Whisper large-v3-turbo，%@用 Qwen3-ASR），並分辨不同的說話者。等待的時候，會議紀錄會先用即時逐字稿整理一份草稿，正式版好了會自動換掉。逐字稿上點「說話者 1」可以改成人名，整場都會跟著改；拾音會記住這個人的聲音，之後的會議自動帶入名字（標「自動」，認錯了點一下就能改）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you press Stop & Transcribe, Shiyin re-transcribes the recording on this Mac (Breeze ASR 25 for Chinese and English, Whisper large-v3-turbo for %@, Qwen3-ASR for %@) and tells the speakers apart. While you wait, the notes are drafted from the live transcript and replaced automatically once the final version is ready. Click \"Speaker 1\" in the transcript to give them a name and it changes throughout the meeting; Shiyin remembers their voice and fills in the name in later meetings (marked \"auto\"; one click fixes a wrong guess)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按“停止并转录”后，拾音会在这台 Mac 上重新转录（中文、英文用 Breeze ASR 25，%@用 Whisper large-v3-turbo，%@用 Qwen3-ASR），并分辨不同的说话者。等待的时候，会议记录会先用实时逐字稿整理一份草稿，正式版好了会自动换掉。逐字稿上点“说话者 1”可以改成人名，整场都会跟着改；拾音会记住这个人的声音，之后的会议自动带入名字（标“自动”，认错了点一下就能改）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「在 GitHub 回報」會用瀏覽器打開新的 issue，並帶入下面的內容，你可以在瀏覽器裡修改後再送出。內容只有版本、環境和錯誤的種類，不包含會議內容、檔名或 API key。沒有 GitHub 帳號的話，可以按「複製」用其他方式寄給維護的人。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Report on GitHub” opens a new issue in your browser with the text below filled in; you can edit it there before submitting. It only contains the version, your setup and the kinds of errors — no meeting content, file names or API keys. If you don’t have a GitHub account, click “Copy” and send it to the maintainer another way."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按“在 GitHub 反馈”会用浏览器打开新的 issue，并带入下面的内容，你可以在浏览器里修改后再送出。内容只有版本、环境和错误的种类，不包含会议内容、文件名或 API key。没有 GitHub 账号的话，可以按“复制”用其他方式寄给维护的人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「錄音」開始，或把錄音檔拖進來。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Record” to start, or drag in a recording."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按“录音”开始，或把录音文件拖进来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按「開始使用」後會打開使用說明，介紹錄音、即時逐字稿、會議紀錄和匯出的用法。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Get Started” to open the guide, which covers recording, the live transcript, meeting notes and exporting."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按“开始使用”后会打开使用说明，介绍录音、实时逐字稿、会议记录和导出的用法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按右上角的「匯出」（⌘E）：會議紀錄可以存成 Markdown、PDF、Word，心智圖可以存成 PNG、PDF、SVG；逐字稿可以存成 txt、srt、vtt、Word；錄音可以存成 m4a、wav；「整場會議（.shiyin）」可以傳給同事，對方雙擊就能匯入。「匯出」旁邊的箭頭可以直接複製會議紀錄或心智圖的圖片，貼到 Notion、Slack 或郵件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Export” (⌘E) at the top right: save meeting notes as Markdown, PDF or Word, and the mind map as PNG, PDF or SVG; the transcript as txt, srt, vtt or Word; the recording as m4a or wav. Send “Whole meeting (.shiyin)” to a colleague, who can double-click it to import. The arrow next to “Export” copies the notes, or the mind map as an image, so you can paste them straight into Notion, Slack or email."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按右上角的“导出”（⌘E）：会议记录可以存成 Markdown、PDF、Word，心智图可以存成 PNG、PDF、SVG；逐字稿可以存成 txt、srt、vtt、Word；录音可以存成 m4a、wav；“整场会议（.shiyin）”可以传给同事，对方双击就能导入。“导出”旁边的箭头可以直接复制会议记录或心智图的图片，贴到 Notion、Slack 或邮件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按工具列的「錄音」（⌘R）開始錄；點按鈕旁的箭頭可以選錄音來源和麥克風，線上會議請選「麥克風＋電腦聲音（線上會議）」，對方的聲音也會錄進來。錄音畫面的音量條旁寫著正在用哪一支麥克風，點一下可以換；藍牙耳機連著時，系統可能自動改用耳機的麥克風，現場會議記得換成這台 Mac 的麥克風。已經有錄音檔的話，拖進視窗、按「匯入」（⌘O），或拖到 Dock 上的拾音圖示都可以。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Record” (⌘R) in the toolbar to start. Click the arrow next to it to choose the source and microphone; for online meetings choose “Microphone + computer audio (online meetings)” so the other side is recorded too. While recording, the microphone in use is shown next to the level meter; click it to switch. When Bluetooth headphones are connected, macOS may switch to their microphone, so for in-person meetings switch back to this Mac’s microphone. If you already have a recording, drag it into the window, click “Import” (⌘O), or drop it on the Shiyin icon in the Dock."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按工具栏的“录音”（⌘R）开始录；点按钮旁的箭头可以选录音来源和麦克风，线上会议请选“麦克风＋电脑声音（线上会议）”，对方的声音也会录进来。录音画面的音量条旁写着正在用哪一支麦克风，点一下可以换；蓝牙耳机连着时，系统可能自动改用耳机的麦克风，现场会议记得换成这台 Mac 的麦克风。已经有录音文件的话，拖进窗口、按“导入”（⌘O），或拖到 Dock 上的拾音图标都可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "掃描的 PDF、圖片用 macOS 的文字辨識讀出文字。一場會議的文件合計最多 4 萬字，太長的只送前面的部分。Keynote、Pages 請先匯出成 PDF。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text in scanned PDFs and images is read with macOS text recognition. A meeting's documents can total up to 40,000 characters; for longer ones only the beginning is sent. Export Keynote and Pages files as PDF first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描的 PDF、图片用 macOS 的文字识别读出文字。一场会议的文档合计最多 4 万字，太长的只送前面的部分。Keynote、Pages 请先导出成 PDF。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
