    "播放錄音時換行，會自動加上當下的播放時間。整理時 AI 會參考這些筆記；改完之後可以從「更多 → 重新處理」選「重新整理會議紀錄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you press Return while the recording is playing, the current playback time is inserted. The AI reads these notes when writing the meeting notes; after editing, choose More → Reprocess → Regenerate Notes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播放录音时换行，会自动加上当下的播放时间。整理时 AI 会参考这些笔记；改完之后可以从“更多 → 重新处理”选“重新整理会议记录”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
