            "value": "整场会议（.shiyin）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整場逐字稿和之後的會議紀錄都會用這個名字；拾音也會記住這個人的聲音，之後的會議自動帶入。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The whole transcript and future meeting notes use this name. Shiyin also remembers this person's voice and fills in the name in future meetings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整场逐字稿和之后的会议记录都会用这个名字；拾音也会记住这个人的声音，之后的会议自动带入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarizing"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、回答待確認、提問、猜說話者時，會把逐字稿文字、你的筆記、加入的文件讀出來的文字和詞彙表送到你選的整理工具，錄音檔和文件的原始檔不會送出。選「不整理」就完全離線。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When writing notes, answering questions to confirm, asking questions, or guessing speakers, the transcript text, your notes, the text read from added documents, and the glossary are sent to the summarizer you chose. Recordings and the original document files are never sent. Choose “Don't summarize” to stay fully offline."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理、回答待确认、提问、猜说话者时，会把逐字稿文字、你的笔记、加入的文档读出来的文字和词汇表送到你选的整理工具，录音文件和文档的源文件不会送出。选“不整理”就完全离线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、提問、猜說話者時會把逐字稿文字、你的筆記、詞彙表和會議基本資料送到 %@。錄音檔不會送出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When summarizing, answering questions or guessing speaker names, the transcript text, your notes, the glossary and basic meeting details are sent to %@. The recording is never sent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理、提问、猜说话者时会把逐字稿文字、你的笔记、词汇表和会议基本资料送到 %@。录音文件不会送出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、提問、猜說話者時會把逐字稿文字、你的筆記、詞彙表和會議基本資料送到 %@。錄音檔不會送出。用 http 傳送沒有加密，建議改用 https。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When summarizing, answering questions or guessing speaker names, the transcript text, your notes, the glossary and basic meeting details are sent to %@. The recording is never sent. http isn't encrypted; use https if you can."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理、提问、猜说话者时会把逐字稿文字、你的笔记、词汇表和会议基本资料送到 %@。录音文件不会送出。用 http 发送没有加密，建议改用 https。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理、提問、猜說話者時會把逐字稿文字、你的筆記、詞彙表和會議基本資料送到 %@（公司的伺服器），再由公司設定的模型整理。錄音檔不會因為整理而送出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When summarizing, answering questions, or guessing speakers, the transcript text, your notes, the glossary and basic meeting details are sent to %@ (your company's server) and processed by the model your company set up. Recordings are not sent for summarizing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理、提问、猜说话者时会把逐字稿文字、你的笔记、词汇表和会议基本资料送到 %@（公司的服务器），再由公司设置的模型整理。录音文件不会因为整理而送出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
