            "value": "整理工具还没设置好：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理成會議紀錄": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarize"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理成会议记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理成紀錄：用你選的 AI 整理成摘要、決議和待辦，只送逐字稿文字。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes: the AI you choose turns it into a summary, decisions and action items; only the transcript text is sent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理成记录：用你选的 AI 整理成摘要、决议和待办，只送逐字稿文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理時有 %lld 題不確定的地方，點了就能回答": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld things the summary wasn't sure about; click to answer"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理时有 %lld 题不确定的地方，点了就能回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理時有一題不確定的地方，點了就能回答": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One thing the summary wasn't sure about; click to answer"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理时有一题不确定的地方，点了就能回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理時沒把握的人名、專有名詞、負責人和期限會列成待確認的題目。紀錄裡有疑問的那一條旁邊會有「？」，點了就能當場回答；紀錄頂部的「還有 N 題待確認」點開可以一次看完。能用是或否回答的直接按「是」「不是」（按「是」不用等整理工具），其他的在「你的回答」欄位回答，按「送出」，會議紀錄就會依你的答案修正；看不懂或不重要的按「略過」，或一次「全部略過」。也可以按「編輯」直接改。改錯了按「編輯」旁的「復原上一版」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Names, terms, owners and due dates the AI was unsure about become items to confirm. The affected line in the notes shows a “?”; click it to answer right there, or open “N items to confirm” at the top of the notes to go through them all. Yes/no questions have Yes and No buttons (Yes needs no AI call); type other answers in the answer field, then press Submit and the notes are revised accordingly. Skip anything unclear or unimportant, or Skip all at once. You can also press Edit to change the notes directly. If something goes wrong, use Restore previous version next to Edit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理时没把握的人名、专有名词、负责人和期限会列成待确认的题目。记录里有疑问的那一条旁边会有“？”，点了就能当场回答；记录顶部的“还有 N 题待确认”点开可以一次看完。能用是或否回答的直接按“是”“不是”（按“是”不用等整理工具），其他的在“你的回答”字段回答，按“送出”，会议记录就会依你的答案修正；看不懂或不重要的按“略过”，或一次“全部略过”。也可以按“编辑”直接改。改错了按“编辑”旁的“恢复上一版”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理會議紀錄、提問時，文件讀出來的文字會一起送給整理工具，幫忙看懂討論、寫對數字和名稱。紀錄還是以會議中講的為準，用到文件的地方會註明出處，會議說的跟文件不一樣時會列成待確認。已經整理好的會議加了文件，按紀錄上方的「重新整理會議紀錄」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When writing notes or answering questions, the text read from the documents is sent along to the summarizer to help it follow the discussion and get numbers and names right. The notes still follow what was said in the meeting: where a document is used, the source is cited, and where the meeting and a document disagree, it becomes a question to confirm. If the meeting already has notes, click “Summarize Again” above the notes after adding documents."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整理会议记录、提问时，文档读出来的文字会一起送给整理工具，帮忙看懂讨论、写对数字和名称。记录还是以会议中讲的为准，用到文档的地方会注明出处，会议说的跟文档不一样时会列成待确认。已经整理好的会议加了文档，按记录上方的“重新整理会议记录”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
