    "每天送一份匿名的使用統計給拾音的開發者：版本、系統、錄音和轉錄了幾分鐘、用了哪些功能、失敗幾次和哪一種失敗。不會送會議標題、逐字稿、會議紀錄、人名、聲紋或任何檔案。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a day, Shiyin sends its developer an anonymous summary: version, system, minutes recorded and transcribed, which features were used, and how many tasks failed and of what kind. It never sends meeting titles, transcripts, notes, names, voiceprints or any files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天送一份匿名的使用统计给拾音的开发者：版本、系统、录音和转录了几分钟、用了哪些功能、失败几次和哪一种失败。不会送会议标题、逐字稿、会议记录、人名、声纹或任何文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每天送一份匿名的使用統計（版本、系統、錄音和轉錄的分鐘數、用了哪些功能、失敗的次數和種類），不含任何會議內容。在設定 → 進階可以關掉。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a day, Shiyin sends an anonymous usage summary (version, system, minutes recorded and transcribed, which features were used, and how many tasks failed and of what kind) that never includes meeting content. You can turn it off in Settings → Advanced."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天送一份匿名的使用统计（版本、系统、录音和转录的分钟数、用了哪些功能、失败的次数和种类），不含任何会议内容。在设置 → 高级可以关掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每換一行會自動加上當下的錄音時間；整理時會優先納入這些內容。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each new line gets the current recording time. These notes are prioritized when summarizing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每换一行会自动加上当下的录音时间；整理时会优先纳入这些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
