    "系統名、產品名、人名的正確寫法。轉錄時會當成提示（最多約 150 字），整理時也會參考。實驗顯示，有沒有詞彙提示，專有名詞的正確率差很多。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Correct spellings of system, product and people's names. They're given to transcription as a hint (up to about 150 characters) and used when summarizing. In tests, the glossary made a big difference for proper nouns."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统名、产品名、人名的正确写法。转录时会当成提示（最多约 150 字），整理时也会参考。实验显示，有没有词汇提示，专有名词的正确率差很多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
