        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "紀錄、逐字稿、提問、即時逐字稿和我的筆記的文字。也可以用 ⌘＋、⌘－ 調整，⌘0 回到標準大小。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text in Notes, Transcript, Ask, the live transcript and My notes. You can also press ⌘+ or ⌘−, and ⌘0 to return to the default size."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录、逐字稿、提问、实时逐字稿和我的笔记的文字。也可以用 ⌘＋、⌘－ 调整，⌘0 回到标准大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "約 1.7 GB 給模型（轉錄 1.66 GB、說話者辨識 21 MB；開%@會議另外 574 MB、自動偵測語言 60 MB），另外加上錄音：轉錄完會壓縮成 m4a，每小時約 10～30 MB": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About 1.7 GB for models (transcription 1.66 GB, speaker recognition 21 MB; another 574 MB for %@ meetings and 60 MB for language detection), plus recordings: they're compressed to m4a after transcription, about 10–30 MB per hour"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "约 1.7 GB 给模型（转录 1.66 GB、说话者识别 21 MB；开%@会议另外 574 MB、自动检测语言 60 MB），另外加上录音：转录完会压缩成 m4a，每小时约 10～30 MB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
