    "聲紋（說話者的聲音特徵，一組數字，不是錄音）只存在這台 Mac，不會放進匯出的 .shiyin 封包。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voiceprints (a speaker's voice features: a list of numbers, not audio) stay on this Mac and are never included in exported .shiyin packages."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "声纹（说话者的声音特征，一组数字，不是录音）只存在这台 Mac，不会放进导出的 .shiyin 文件包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聲音有點小：手機或筆電放近說話的人一點。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sound is a bit quiet: move the phone or laptop closer to the people speaking."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "声音有点小：手机或笔电放近说话的人一点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聽起來是%@，即時逐字稿和會議語言已經改成%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This sounds like %@. The live transcript and meeting language are now %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听起来是%@，实时逐字稿和会议语言已经改成%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "背景有點吵，說話者可能分不準。錄完可以用「重新辨識說話者」告訴拾音大約幾個人。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It’s a bit noisy, so speakers may get mixed up. After recording, use “Identify Speakers Again” to tell Shiyin roughly how many people there were."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "背景有点吵，说话者可能分不准。录完可以用“重新识别说话者”告诉拾音大约几个人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
