    "轉錄模型還沒下載好，會先用 macOS 內建辨識轉錄；可以到「設定 → 錄音與轉錄」下載，用模型轉錄比較準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The transcription model is not downloaded yet, so the macOS built-in recognizer is used for now. Download it in Settings → Recording & Transcription for better accuracy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录模型还没下载好，会先用 macOS 内建识别转录；可以到“设置 → 录音与转录”下载，用模型转录比较准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄（macOS 內建）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcribing (macOS)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录（macOS 内建）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "轉錄：錄音會送到 %@（公司的伺服器），轉完就刪。說話者辨識和聲紋在這台 Mac 上做，聲紋、筆記、會議紀錄不會因為轉錄送出。伺服器用的轉錄引擎：%@。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription: recordings are sent to %1$@ (your company's server) and deleted after transcription. Speaker identification and voiceprints stay on this Mac; voiceprints, notes and meeting notes are not sent for transcription. Transcription engine on the server: %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转录：录音会送到 %@（公司的服务器），转完就删。说话者识别和声纹在这台 Mac 上做，声纹、笔记、会议记录不会因为转录送出。服务器用的转录引擎：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "辨識信心低，建議對照錄音確認": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
