    "逐字稿裡改過的文字會換成新的逐字稿，說話者的名字會留著": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edits to the transcript text are replaced by the new transcript; speaker names are kept"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐字稿里改过的文字会换成新的逐字稿，说话者的名字会留着"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "逐字稿裡琥珀色的段落辨識信心比較低，值得回頭聽；時間軸上的三角形是待確認題目、圓點是你標的重點；時間軸上面的色塊是議題，點了從那個議題開始聽。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amber segments in the transcript have lower recognition confidence and are worth listening to again. On the timeline, triangles are questions to confirm and dots are your bookmarks; the colored blocks above it are topics — click one to listen from where that topic starts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐字稿里琥珀色的段落识别置信度比较低，值得回头听；时间轴上的三角形是待确认题目、圆点是你标的重点；时间轴上面的色块是议题，点了从那个议题开始听。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
