            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音或导入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音或轉錄、整理進行中，完成後再更新": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording, transcription or summarizing is in progress. Update when it's done."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音或转录、整理进行中，完成后再更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音按鈕旁的箭頭、錄音畫面也可以換麥克風。藍牙耳機連著時，系統預設可能會自動變成耳機的麥克風，現場會議請選這台 Mac 的麥克風。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also switch microphones from the arrow next to Record and on the recording screen. When Bluetooth headphones are connected, the system default may switch to their microphone; for in-person meetings, choose this Mac’s microphone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音按钮旁的箭头、录音画面也可以换麦克风。蓝牙耳机连着时，系统默认可能会自动变成耳机的麦克风，现场会议请选这台 Mac 的麦克风。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音時間軸": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording timeline"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音时间轴"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音會交給公司的伺服器轉錄。要改回這台 Mac，到「設定 → 進階 → 企業伺服器」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings will be transcribed on your company's server. To switch back to this Mac, go to Settings → Advanced → Enterprise Server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音会交给公司的服务器转录。要改回这台 Mac，到“设置 → 高级 → 企业服务器”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音會先存好，下次開啟拾音時開始轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The recording will be saved and transcribed the next time you open Shiyin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音会先存好，下次打开拾音时开始转录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音會送到 %@（公司的伺服器）轉錄，轉完就刪；說話者辨識和聲紋在這台 Mac 上做，聲紋不會送出。會參考詞彙表。連不上時會等，也可以改在這台 Mac 轉錄。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings are sent to %@ (your company's server) for transcription and deleted afterwards; speaker identification and voiceprints stay on this Mac. Uses the glossary. If the server can't be reached, Shiyin waits, or you can transcribe on this Mac instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音会送到 %@（公司的服务器）转录，转完就删；说话者识别和声纹在这台 Mac 上做，声纹不会送出。会参考词汇表。连不上时会等，也可以改在这台 Mac 转录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "錄音檔太小，沒有內容": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
