          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麦克风权限设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麥克風沒有收到聲音：可能被靜音、被其他 app 佔用，或選錯了麥克風。可以在設定的「錄音與轉錄」換一個。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone isn’t picking up any sound. It may be muted, in use by another app, or the wrong microphone. You can choose another one in Settings → Recording & Transcription."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "麦克风没有收到声音：可能被静音、被其他 app 占用，或选错了麦克风。可以在设置的“录音与转录”换一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "麥克風沒有送出聲音，正在重新連接…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone stopped sending audio. Reconnecting…"
